            "notes": "[Dragons' Incinerator](item_d0794681-844b-4ce8-9857-15320f35a634) Will allow us to become immortal during Rally\n\nRebuy Greens and if you can afford it get a rare,\n[Cushioned Padding](item_20f2f4bc-4611-4d1f-b653-20f04d56b96f) against ana.\n[Vital-E-Tee](item_b92e6f1d-3aac-4eec-b027-00c8e1529016) if you feel like you cant survive.\n[Nano Cola](item_79b22609-8046-4a8a-a5a2-bb49cd7e11c6)/[Multi-tool](item_5ba8d94e-f2f3-44b7-8773-025fc6ed7c56) For general damage.\n\n\nWe finally got [Aura Farming](item_b2416f42-1aa6-440a-8080-86290f5556c0) \nAura farming procs on every shield throw proc giving us insane overhealth uptime for the whole team while farming rallys in seconds.\n\nFocus on farming rally from max whip/shield throw range then go in on rally and abuse [Dragons' Incinerator](item_d0794681-844b-4ce8-9857-15320f35a634)",
